# Trained artefacts and generated data — regenerate with `python -m gridtrace.train`.
# The model bundle is a version-sensitive pickle; committing it invites silent
# wrong results when the reader's scikit-learn differs from the writer's.
*.joblib
*.ndjson
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
gridtrace/data/localization.json

